config MMC_QC07F_CANDIDATE
	bool "QC07F MCI source-review candidate (probe refuses)"
	depends on MMC && OF && ARM
	default n
	help
	  Offline source/build candidate only. Probe unconditionally refuses
	  before claiming resources or starting card discovery. A measured,
	  reviewed routing/clock/shared-L2 retirement provider is still absent.
	  This is not SDHCI, SD support, or a qualified Linux block path.
